<title>UK: LME publishes June TAPOs settlement prices.</title>
<headline>LME publishes June TAPOs settlement prices.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) monthly average settlement prices for copper and primary aluminium TAPOs for June were as follows.</p>
<p>    Copper-Grade A    - $2,612.62 a tonne.</p>
<p>    Primary Aluminium - $1,567.90 a tonne.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542-8075</p>
</text>
